  "title": "Alaska Airlines’ statement on extension of the AS+HA acquisition regulatory review period",
  "summary": "Since January of this year, Alaska Airlines and Hawaiian Airlines have been cooperatively engaged with the U.S. Department of Justice (DOJ) as it reviews the proposed combination of our two airlines. Earlier this year, the parties agreed to extend the time period the DOJ had to review the proposed transaction to August 5, 2024. Our…",
